:"webp", "kind":"", "style":"halfScreen"}, {"url":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/2026/01/22/131/2faf6caccd3d56e79e30b05992948198.webp?x-oss-process=style/fullScreen", "width":"1404", "height":"789", "format":"webp", "kind":"", "style":"fullScreen"}, {"url":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/2026/01/22/131/2faf6caccd3d56e79e30b05992948198.webp?x-oss-process=style/thirdScreen", "width":"436", "height":"245", "format":"webp", "kind":"", "style":"thirdScreen"}, {"url":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/2026/01/22/131/2faf6caccd3d56e79e30b05992948198.webp?x-oss-process=style/fullScreenLandscape", "width":"1224", "height":"689", "format":"webp", "kind":"", "style":"fullScreenLandscape"}], "isAIGC":false}], "videoList":[], "caption":[{"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"《明日方舟：终末地》地图工具试运营已开启，点击下方跳转链接即可前往！"}}, {"kind":"link", "link":{"link":"https://game.skland.com/map/endfield?header=0", "text":">>>前往《明日方舟：终末地》地图工具<<<"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"管理员也可使用浏览器搜索「《明日方舟：终末地》地图」，或前往官方社区APP「森空岛」体验。"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"▼//地图工具简介"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"地图工具整合了游戏中各类位置信息，支持管理员快速查询、筛选及定位各种关键点位。使用鹰角通行证登录后，管理员还可以查看自己建造的滑索、供电桩等游戏内工业设施的位置，助力探索与建设。"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"▼//基础使用说明"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"管理员可以通过点选左侧的点位分类，找到分类下的相应设施、敌人或物品，点击选中即可查看其在当前地图上的分布情况，方便管理员规划自己的探索路线。 同时，在点击点位页签时，管理员还可以对单个点位进行标记操作，一键记录自己的探索历程。"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"▼//分层地图功能"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"工具提供了分层地图功能。选中【地图探索-分层入口】，即可查看当前地图的全部分层入口信息。选中某个分层入口后，还可以进一步选取具体的层级，查看所选层级的地图。在分层地图中的点位将被特殊标记，方便管理员更快地找到某个具体的点位。"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"▼//数据同步功能"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"为便于管理员查看游戏内建造的工业设施的情况，助您更便捷地探索建设塔卫二，您使用鹰角通行证登录森空岛并使用地图工具时，我们会获取您在游戏内的工业设施数据。由于数据量较大，数据同步可能存在一定延迟，感谢管理员的理解。"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"▼//关于地图标点"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"随着游戏版本更新，《明日方舟：终末地》地图工具中的标点也将持续更新。使用过程中，如果管理员发现标点信息有误，请在对应标点的点位卡片中，点击【反馈】按钮提交反馈。"}}, {"strikeThrough":false, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"※地图工具还在不断优化中，后续也将持续进行功能迭代及更新，具体信息以游戏内实际情况为准。"}}], "downloadEnable":true, "coverImageId":"6971a9d83af0cbfacc5304e1", "tagIds":[297], "timestamp":"1769058039", "ipLocation":"上海", "latestReplyAtTs":"1776567114", "userId":"131", "publishedAtTs":"1769058039"}, "user":{"id":"7532688806929", "nickname":"终末地Delta机器人", "profile":"滴///资料传输完毕，正在接入塔卫二智库系统——您的探索之旅，由Delta机器人守护。", "avatar":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/asset/private/avatar/10e546ed1c89d8979629bf3a6ab59c06.webp", "isCreator":false, "identity":2, "latestIpLocation":"未知", "isModerator":false, "status":1, "operationStatus":30, "createdAtTs":"0"}, "tags":[{"id":297, "name":"明日方舟：终末地", "kind":1, "isGameEvent":false}], "itemRel":{"like":false, "collect":false}, "userRel":{"follow":false, "fans":false, "black":false, "blacked":false, "blocked":false, "fansAtTs":0}, "itemRts":{"liked":"611", "collected":"368", "reposted":"0", "commented":"295", "attitudes":[{"id":"default", "count":"608", "weight":6}, {"id":"kiss", "count":"1", "weight":5}, {"id":"call", "count":"1", "weight":4}, {"id":"agree", "count":"1", "weight":3}, {"id":"cry", "count":"0", "weight":2}, {"id":"shock", "count":"0", "weight":1}]}, "game":{"gameId":3, "name":"明日方舟：终末地"}, "cate":{"id":12, "name":"明日方舟：终末地"}}, {"item":{"id":"3622694", "viewKind":3, "gameId":3, "cateId":12, "status":1, "title":"「每日签到」游戏工具上线！", "imageList":[{"id":"69719999c9e9871dee6d5bb4", "url":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/2026/01/22/131/e308139ae27cc563ed5c01f9d9cba49a.webp", "width":"1920", "height":"1080", "size":"140796", "format":"webp", "kind":"static", "description":"", "infos":[{"url":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/2026/01/22/131/e308139ae27cc563ed5c01f9d9cba49a.webp", "width":"1920", "height":"1080", "format":"webp", "kind":"", "style":"origin"}, {"url":"https://