], "isAIGC":false}, {"id":"696f7936a59001b9ad150382", "url":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/2026/01/20/131/c8ed40bfa2d8a726a5f61f091720aa87.webp", "width":"1014", "height":"474", "size":"55214", "format":"webp", "kind":"static", "description":"", "infos":[{"url":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/2026/01/20/131/c8ed40bfa2d8a726a5f61f091720aa87.webp", "width":"1014", "height":"474", "format":"webp", "kind":"", "style":"origin"}, {"url":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/2026/01/20/131/c8ed40bfa2d8a726a5f61f091720aa87.webp?x-oss-process=style/halfScreen", "width":"655", "height":"306", "format":"webp", "kind":"", "style":"halfScreen"}, {"url":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/2026/01/20/131/c8ed40bfa2d8a726a5f61f091720aa87.webp?x-oss-process=style/fullScreen", "width":"1404", "height":"656", "format":"webp", "kind":"", "style":"fullScreen"}, {"url":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/2026/01/20/131/c8ed40bfa2d8a726a5f61f091720aa87.webp?x-oss-process=style/thirdScreen", "width":"436", "height":"203", "format":"webp", "kind":"", "style":"thirdScreen"}, {"url":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/2026/01/20/131/c8ed40bfa2d8a726a5f61f091720aa87.webp?x-oss-process=style/fullScreenLandscape", "width":"1404", "height":"656", "format":"webp", "kind":"", "style":"fullScreenLandscape"}], "isAIGC":false}], "videoList":[], "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"滴///管理员您好，为您准备的《明日方舟：终末地》桌面小组件，将在《明日方舟：终末地》全球公测后正式推出！为了帮助管理员更轻松地使用小组件，我们准备了工具说明与添加指引。"}}, {"bold":true, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"▼//《明日方舟：终末地》桌面小组件说明"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"管理员可通过【桌面小组件】更加便捷地查询理智恢复情况、日常任务进度等实时游戏数据信息，还可从小组件前往每日签到工具完成签到并领取签到奖励、通过桌面小组件直接启动《明日方舟：终末地》。"}}, {"bold":true, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"▼//《明日方舟：终末地》桌面小组件添加指引"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"■ iOS设备小组件添加指引"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"1.前往桌面空白处，长按进入编辑状态；"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"2.点击左上角【编辑 - 添加小组件】；"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"3.搜索森空岛，找到《明日方舟：终末地》数据工具，添加小组件。"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"■ 安卓设备小组件添加指引"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"1.前往桌面空白处，长按或双指向内捏合进入编辑状态；"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"2.选择【小组件】/【小部件】/【插件】/【添加】/【服务卡片 - 窗口小工具】；"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"※ 由于安卓设备机型较多，各个设备机型之间会有差异，请管理员以设备实际小组件添加入口为准。"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"3.搜索森空岛，找到《明日方舟：终末地》数据工具，添加小组件。"}}, {"bold":true, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"▼//特别说明"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"1.请先绑定您的《明日方舟：终末地》游戏账号，部分管理员在绑定账号时，系统将通过游戏内邮件发送验证码，验证码邮件存在发送延迟的情况，请耐心等待。"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"2.为保障设备性能和电池续航，桌面小组件的数据刷新频率会受到iOS/安卓的系统规则限制，在一定延迟范围内动态刷新，实际刷新频率会受到手机系统设置及其他操作行为影响等多种因素影响。若遇到小组件数据延迟，还请您耐心等待。"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"3.使用安卓设备的部分管理员可能无法通过桌面小组件启动游戏，感谢管理员的理解与支持。"}}], "downloadEnable":true, "coverImageId":"696f790bb2f67ac5ed882aa8", "tagIds":[297], "timestamp":"1768971622", "ipLocation":"上海", "latestReplyAtTs":"1786108662", "userId":"131", "publishedAtTs":"1768971622"}, "user":{"id":"7532688806929", "nickname":"终末地Delta机器人", "profile":"滴///资料传输完毕，正在接入塔卫二智库系统——您的探索之旅，由Delta机器人守护。", "avatar":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/asset/private/avatar/10e546ed1c89d8979629bf3a6ab59c06.webp", "isCreator":false, "identity":2, "latestIpLocation":"未知", "isModerator":false, "status":1, "operationStatus":30, "createdAtTs":"0"}, "tags":[{"id":297, "name":"明日方舟：终末地", "kind":1, "isGameEvent":false}], "itemRel":{"like":false, "collect":false}, "userRel":{"follow":false, "fans":false, "black":false, "blacked":false, "blocked":false, "fansAtTs":0}, "itemRts":{"liked":"1767", "collected":"552", "reposted":"0", "commented":"647", "attitudes":[{"id":"default", "count":"1700", "weight":6}, {"id":"kiss", "count":"44", "weight":5}, {"id":"agree", "count":"12", "weight":3}, {"id":"call", "count":"11", "weight":4}, {"id":"cry", "count":"0", "weight":2}, {"id":"shock", "count":"0", "weight":1}]}, "game":{"gameId":3, "name":"明日方舟：终末地"}, "cate":{"id":12, "name":"明日方舟：终末地"}}, {"item":{"id":"3611131", "viewKind":3, "gameId":3, "cateId":12, "status":1, "title":"《明日方舟：终末地》WIKI试运营开启！", "imageList":[{"id":"696f7791c9f0dcc56848aaaf", "